OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FAlthough some bright spells
OL,6,Fare possible, especially in the east,
OL,7,FFriday generally looks rather cloudy.
OL,8,FEarly mist and fog patches gradually
OL,9,Flifting. Occasional light rain could
OL,10,Falso affect westernmost areas.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,13,FSaturday looks fine with any early fog
OL,14,Flifting to leave some sunshine. A
OL,15,Fchance of some showery rain on Sunday,
OL,16,Fthen becoming mostly dry, albeit
OL,17,Fbreezy on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
